gration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"ability":{"value":"cha"},"spelldc":{"value":32,"dc":40},"tradition":{"value":"primal"},"prepared":{"value":"innate"},"showSlotlessLevels":{"value":false},"proficiency":{"value":1},"slots":{"slot0":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot1":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot2":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot3":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot4":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot5":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot6":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot7":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot8":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot9":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot10":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot11":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0}},"autoHeightenLevel":{"value":null}},"_id":"JYeJtcwRUD3yUr20","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/spellcastingEntry.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"folder":"IfuYSF4ymX48CZnm","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/canticle-of-everlasting-grief.webp","name":"Canticle of Everlasting Grief","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You create a melody distilled from pure grief, conveying the inevitable loss of everything your target cherishes, audible to only them. The target takes 10d6 mental damage depending on its Will save. A creature cursed by this spell can't benefit from circumstance or status bonuses, for the duration noted in the degree of success.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes half damage, is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 1}, and is cursed for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes full damage, is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 3}, and is cursed for 1 week.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target takes double damage, is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 4}, and is cursed for an unlimited duration. While the curse remains, the target's allies are also affected by the curse while within 15 feet of the creature.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"canticle-of-everlasting-grief","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["auditory","concentrate","curse","emotion","fear","manipulate","mental"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":8},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"varies","sustained":false},"damage":{"XBFtljOdUx24bHoA":{"applyMod":false,"category":null,"formula":"10d6","kinds":["damage"],"materials":[],"type":"mental"}},"defense":{"save":{"basic":true,"statistic":"will"}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"JYeJtcwRUD3yUr20","heightenedLevel":8},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.qlxM7Ik3uUeUIOcv","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"aoLcKUSZqY4r4uR9"},{"folder":"xqlqJ6eeiNtWb7bq","img":"icons/commodities/treasure/mask-wood-tan.webp","name":"Mask of Terror","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The target appears to be a gruesome and terrifying creature. The effect is unique to each observer, so a human viewing the target might see a demon with bloody fangs, but a demon observing the target might see a glowing angelic visage.</p>\n<p>When any creature attempts a hostile action against the target, the creature must attempt a Will save. It is then temporarily immune until the end of its next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2} before using its action.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.TBSHQspnbcqxsmjL]{Frightened 2}, and its action fails and is wasted.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (8th)</strong> You can target up to 5 creatures. If a creature uses a hostile action or reaction that affects multiple targets simultaneously, it needs to attempt only one save against <em>mask of terror</em>.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"mask-of-terror","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","emotion","fear","illusion","manipulate","mental","visual"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":7},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 minute","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":{"save":{"basic":false,"statistic":"will"}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"JYeJtcwRUD3yUr20","heightenedLevel":8,"uses":{"max":2,"value":2}},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.O6VQC1Bs4aSYDa6R","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"ZJkFUtPMRm4G4wnn"},{"type":"spell","name":"Dissonance","folder":"pcjidaJ7lvxI8BEP","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You induce deafening and nauseating vibrations throughout the bodies of all creatures in the area, dealing 5d10 sonic damage with a Fortitude save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9PR9y0bi4JPKnHPR]{Deafened} for [[/gmr 1d4 #rounds]]{1d4 rounds}.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage, is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}, and is deafened for 1 minute.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes double damage, is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 3}, and is deafened for 1 hour.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d10.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"uncommon","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":5},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"200 feet"},"area":{"value":20,"type":"burst"},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{"cmZrdRqRiH1Hg3Mb":{"formula":"5d10","kinds":["damage"],"type":"sonic","category":null,"materials":[],"applyMod":false}},"defense":{"save":{"statistic":"fortitude","basic":false}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"JYeJtcwRUD3yUr20","heightenedLevel":7,"uses":{"max":3,"value":3}},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"type":"interval","interval":1,"damage":{"cmZrdRqRiH1Hg3Mb":"1d10"},"area":0}},"img":"icons/magic/sonic/projectile-sound-rings-wave.webp","effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e.spells.Item.M2uQp36xa8fzsyAZ","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"_id":"IQ1IKJjUbZUt5t1I"},{"folder":"lPzcDrjGDFbzuF2r","img":"icons/magic/air/fog-gas-smoke-dense-white.webp","name":"Mist (At Will)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You call forth a cloud of mist. All creatures within the mist become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed}, and all creatures outside the mist become concealed to creatures within it. You can Dismiss the cloud.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"mist","_migration":{"version":0.942,"lastMigration":null,"previous":null},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","water"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":"","license":"ORC","remaster":true},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":{"type":"burst","value":20},"time":{"value":"3"},"duration":{"value":"1 minute","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"JYeJtcwRUD3yUr20","heightenedLevel":2},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.9XHmC2JgTUIQ1CCm","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"ba4kGgjKqbo9ZAGB"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Reaction.webp","name":"Reactive Strike","system":{"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.ReactiveStrike]</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core","authors":""},"rules":[],"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"reactive-strike","_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.W7SbTykXrNwxDzJc","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"8v5O71VNhIm27KG1"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Void Healing","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Monster Core","authors":""},"rules":[{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"override","path":"system.attributes.hp.negativeHealing","value":true}],"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"void-healing","_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.TTCw5NusiSSkJU1x","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_id":"83AfqSiMtic8gDnT"},{"type":"action","name":"Cloudsight","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>Nimbus dirges ignore concealment from weather conditions, including clouds and rain.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"interaction","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"F8auYiQGctGFkl2J","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Aura of Winds","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>20 feet. Nimbus dirges are constantly cloaked in harsh winds. All physical ranged attacks against them take a –2 circumstance penalty, and air within the aura is difficult terrain for flying creatures that don't have the air trait. When a creature enters or starts its turn within the aura, it must succeed on a @Check[reflex|dc:38] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 1} until the end of its next turn (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 2} on a critical failure).</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"key":"Aura","radius":20,"traits":["air","primal"],"effects":[]},{"key":"EphemeralEffect","uuid":"Compendium.battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e.effects.Item.9PVujDUboANADj8m","affects":"origin","selectors":["attack-roll"]}],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["air","aura","primal"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"iAZ1dSOOPtRwQIiA","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Nostalgic Grief","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>Nimbus dirges recall what it meant to make beautiful music to inspire others, and the sound of others performing from the heart overwhelms them with grief. A creature can attempt a Performance check in place of an Intimidation check to [[/act demoralize skill=performance]] them. If the creature rolls a success on the check, they get a criti